    "detailed_description": "Pick up your weapons, plant diverse plants, confront the constantly attacking monsters, and protect the holy tree behind you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGrasp the weapon in your hand, defeat the incoming monsters to obtain fertilizer that you can  plant different plants. Also, using the fruits of plants and the holy power provided by the holy tree can help you build Fortification!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs time passing, the monsters will become more stronger! You need to use all your resources to defeat them until the last day come.At that day,you need to defeat the boss andd win the game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, may be you can constantly explore deeper plots, perhaps finding the true reason for exploring the magical attack on the Holy Tree?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMain features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7This is a game that combines action and tower defense elements<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7Encounter different monsters at a fixed time period<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7There will be continuous more updates in the future",
